++Dry-run does not require `PATHOS_ENV` or `--confirm-staging-write`.
+ 
+ ```powershell
+-$env:PATHOS_ENV="staging"
+ $env:USAJOBS_API_KEY="<staging-usajobs-key>"
+ $env:USAJOBS_USER_AGENT="<staging-user-agent>"
